<title>USA: North Face advance autumn orders up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>North Face advance autumn orders up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SAN LEANDRO, Calif. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Face Inc on Thursday said total advance orders for the 1997 autumn season were 27 percent higher than last autumn's advance orders.</p>
<p>For the 1997 season, advance wholesale orders rose to $87.9 million from $69.1 million the year earlier.</p>
<p>The company makes outerwear, skiwear, functional sportswear, tents, sleeping bags and backpacks.</p>
